Description: independent VpnHood-compatible server management panel
 Rust management service with tenant isolation, access policies,
 encrypted server credentials and a web interface in Turkish, Arabic
 and English. VPN traffic goes directly to each tenant's own servers.
 Initial database and owner setup are explicit administrator actions.
